{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120160509717-1120_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261120160509\"/><p>涉事青年疑在商場內發生衝突。（電視畫面）</p><p>澳洲新南威爾士省悉尼西北部一個商場周五（20日）下午有2名少年被刀刺傷，其中一人情況嚴重。</p><p>警方於當地下午3時30分接報涉事商場發生襲擊事件，警員到場發現兩名青年身上均有刀傷。事發地點在美食廣場附近，有不少人，一名目擊者聲稱傷者發生爭執後用刀互刺對方。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.304106+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:05:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:37:34.862678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:24.163505+00:00","content_hash":"3c52924e534f85cb02a842051a351db604207e3d7c8e7caa14c742871f57b0d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}